*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal interview-preparation notes. Local only, never published.
# This repo is public, and prep/09-fix-list.md in particular is a precise
# writeup of this app's own weaknesses — publishing it would hand out a map.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
prep/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS cruft (this repo lives inside a OneDrive-synced folder)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vercel CLI project link.
#
# The CLI appended `.vercel` and `.env*` here itself. The `.env*` line was a
# silent bug: gitignore resolves last-match-wins, so it overrode the
# `!.env.example` negation above and made the template ignored by rule.
# `.env.example` only survived because it was already tracked — deleting and
# re-adding it would have failed with no obvious cause. Secrets are already
# covered by the `.env` / `.env.*` block above, so the duplicate line is gone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vercel
